<title>USA: Brock Int'l names Macintyre as president.</title>
<headline>Brock Int'l names Macintyre as president.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brock International Inc on Thursday said it named R. Douglas MacIntyre as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He replaces Richard T. Brock, who relinquished those positions. Brock will remain as chairman.</p>
<p>MacIntyre was also elected to the company's board.</p>
<p>MacIntyre was president, chief executive and a director of Dun &amp; Bradstreet Software, a unit of Geac Computer Corp.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610.</p>
